{"id":"d47484adcb88c697","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-fourier-sobolev-space.md","title":"Fourier Sobolev Space","display":"df-fourier-sobolev-space — Fourier Sobolev Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-fourier-sobolev-space","aliases":["58-df-fourier-sobolev-space"],"display":"df-fourier-sobolev-space — Fourier Sobolev Space","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-tempered-distribution.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-fourier-transform.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-fourier-sobolev-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-fourier-sobolev-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fourier-sobolev-space — Fourier Sobolev Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76ff911ecd7b22c8\" href=\"?note=76ff911ecd7b22c8\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-tempered-distribution.md\">../batch02/58-df-tempered-distribution.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6c5654857edae16\" href=\"?note=a6c5654857edae16\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md\">../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5111035a66b30703\" href=\"?note=5111035a66b30703\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md\">../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c24c7e81186cbc4b\" href=\"?note=c24c7e81186cbc4b\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-fourier-transform.md\">../batch19/58-df-fourier-transform.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_n=\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(\\mathcal S_n=\\mathcal S_{\\mathbb C}(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-complex-schwartz-data</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n\">\\(\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data</code>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S&#39;_n\">\\(\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\)</span> 是下面定义的集合，不是真类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-fourier-transform</code> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e^{-2\\pi i x\\cdot\\xi}\">\\(e^{-2\\pi i x\\cdot\\xi}\\)</span> 归一化。分布对测试函数复线性，配对不加复共轭。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\">\\(H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\)</span> 的元素为分布；不与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^2\">\\(L^2\\)</span> 的等价类或逐点函数混同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\cdot\\|_{H^s}\">\\(\\|\\cdot\\|_{H^s}\\)</span> 仅在该集合上定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_n\">\\(J_n\\)</span> 的定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_n\">\\(\\mathcal S_n\\)</span>，给出 Schwartz 函数对应的正则分布。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)\\)</span> 为标准复平面的 Borel 代数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|\\xi\\|_2=(\\sum_{j\\in n}\\xi(j)^2)^{1/2}\">\\(\\|\\xi\\|_2=(\\sum_{j\\in n}\\xi(j)^2)^{1/2}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"aT+bU=\\{\\langle\\varphi,aT(\\varphi)+bU(\\varphi)\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S_n\\}\">\\(aT+bU=\\{\\langle\\varphi,aT(\\varphi)+bU(\\varphi)\\rangle:\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S_n\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\">\\(T,U\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaTemperedDistribution}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaTemperedDistribution}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"76ff911ecd7b22c8\" href=\"?note=76ff911ecd7b22c8\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-tempered-distribution.md\">../batch02/58-df-tempered-distribution.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measurable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measurable}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AeClass}\">\\(\\mathrm{AeClass}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a1d034d5d39b4a14\" href=\"?note=a1d034d5d39b4a14\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-lp-space.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BesselNormValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{BesselNormValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FourierTemperedDistribution}\">\\(\\mathrm{FourierTemperedDistribution}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal S_n}:\\mathrm{ZfcAnaTemperedDistribution}_S(T,n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal S_n}:\\mathrm{ZfcAnaTemperedDistribution}_S(T,n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S(T,f,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S\n\\bigl(T(\\varphi),\\{\\langle x,f(x)\\varphi(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\},\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S(T,f,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nT\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\land f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\n\\land\\mathrm{Measurable}_S(f;(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n),(\\mathbb C,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb C)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;\\mathrm{ComplexIntegralValue}_S\n\\bigl(T(\\varphi),\\{\\langle x,f(x)\\varphi(x)\\rangle:x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\},\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FourierTemperedDistribution}_S(U,T,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;T,U\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S(\\varphi,\\psi,n)\\land U(\\varphi)=T(\\psi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FourierTemperedDistribution}_S(U,T,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;T,U\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathcal S_n\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaFourierTransform}_S(\\varphi,\\psi,n)\\land U(\\varphi)=T(\\psi)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BesselNormValue}_S(r,T,n,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nr\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\land T\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\land s\\in\\mathbb R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists U\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\;\\exists g,w\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\\exists v\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{FourierTemperedDistribution}_S(U,T,n)\\land\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S(U,g,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(w(\\xi)=(1+4\\pi^2\\|\\xi\\|_2^2)^{s/2}g(\\xi))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land v=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(w;\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)\n\\land v\\in L^2(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)\\land r=\\|v\\|_{L^2(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BesselNormValue}_S(r,T,n,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nr\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\land T\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\land s\\in\\mathbb R\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists U\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\;\\exists g,w\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb R^n}\\;\\exists v\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{FourierTemperedDistribution}_S(U,T,n)\\land\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S(U,g,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^n\\;(w(\\xi)=(1+4\\pi^2\\|\\xi\\|_2^2)^{s/2}g(\\xi))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land v=\\mathrm{AeClass}_S(w;\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)\n\\land v\\in L^2(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)\\land r=\\|v\\|_{L^2(\\mathbb R^n,\\mathcal B_n,\\lambda_n)}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n:\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\mathrm{BesselNormValue}_S(r,T,n,s)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\coloneqq\\{T\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n:\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\mathrm{BesselNormValue}_S(r,T,n,s)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\to\\exists!r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\mathrm{BesselNormValue}_S(r,T,n,s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\to\\exists!r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\;\\mathrm{BesselNormValue}_S(r,T,n,s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\to\n\\bigl(\\|T\\|_{H^s(\\mathbb R^n)}=r\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BesselNormValue}_S(r,T,n,s)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\in H^s(\\mathbb R^n)\\to\n\\bigl(\\|T\\|_{H^s(\\mathbb R^n)}=r\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{BesselNormValue}_S(r,T,n,s)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathcal S_n\\to\\exists!T\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\;\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S(T,u,n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\in\\mathcal S_n\\to\\exists!T\\in\\mathcal S&#39;_n\\;\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S(T,u,n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"J_n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,T\\rangle\\in\\mathcal S_n\\times\\mathcal S&#39;_n:\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S(T,u,n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[J_n\\coloneqq\\{\\langle u,T\\rangle\\in\\mathcal S_n\\times\\mathcal S&#39;_n:\\mathrm{RegularTemperedDistribution}_S(T,u,n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>整数阶实 Sobolev 空间与这里的复分布空间保持各自的原接口；两者的规范实现不作集合层面的强行等同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-tempered-distribution.md","status":"resolved","id":"76ff911ecd7b22c8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-tempered-distribution.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"a6c5654857edae16","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-complex-schwartz-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-euclidean-lebesgue-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5111035a66b30703","anch